  "edge_schema": "ledgerloop_edge_saas",
  "prompt": "In each account segment, how many users closed the month-end funnel in the app within a day per step, over all the app events (October to December 2025)? A user starts the funnel at the user's first upload_statement event. The user counts as matched in time with a match_transaction event at or after that first upload and at most 1 day (24 hours) after it, and as exported in time with an export_report event at or after the first such match and at most 1 day after that match. A user belongs to the segment of the account of the user's app events. Return five columns, in this order: segment, uploaded, matched_in_1_day, exported_in_1_day (each a number of users) and overall_rate, exported_in_1_day over uploaded, as a fraction between 0 and 1. Return one row for each segment with a user who uploaded a statement. Any row order is fine.",
